Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Kaxxaforti ġdid: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault ikkripta: message ċavetta: key.
>> decrypted := vault iddekripta: encrypted ċavetta: key.

Ħruġ 
ikteb: ['Message:'], linja-ġdida
ikteb: message, linja-ġdida
ikteb: ['Decrypted:'], linja-ġdida
ikteb: decrypted, linja-ġdida.
